the Sixers and Cavaliers especially, San Antonio hammered out its victory over OKC across seven games, ample exposure of the Spurs’ many strengths and potential weaknesses. Those additional outings gave the young West champions extra time to gel as the title contender they’ve become. But I’m going with the saltier, more veteran-laden team – Jalen Brunson is irrepressible against all defenders and Karl-Anthony Towns will test Victor Wembanyama’s mobility and versatility beyond any big Wemby has faced this spring. Youth must be served, the saying goes – but not yet."],["P",{"style":"margin-left:0px;"},["STRONG",{},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://cdn.nba.com/logos/nba/1610612752/primary/L/72x72/logo.png?imageView2/0/w/1200/q/75/format/webp","class":"image_resized","style":"border-radius:0.25rem;border:0px solid;box-sizing:border-box;display:block;height:40px;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:auto;","src":"https://cdn.nba.com/logos/nba/1610612752/primary/L/72x72/logo.png?imageView2/0/w/1200/q/75/format/webp","alt":"New York Knicks logo","decoding":"async","height":"40"}],"  Knicks in 6, with Brunson as Finals MVP"]],["HR"],["P",{"style":"margin-left:0px;"},"Brian Martin"],["P",{"style":"margin-left:0px;"},"The Knicks paid their dues, suffering playoff defeats the past three seasons before breaking through in historic fashion in 2026, entering the Finals with 11 straight wins and the ",["A",{"href":"https://www.nba.com/news/starting-5-may-26-2026"},"largest point differential (+271) in playoff history"],"."],["P",{"style":"margin-left:0px;"},"Conversely, the Spurs are ahead of schedule, vaulting from 13th in the West a year ago to their first Finals of the Victor Wembanyama era. The Spurs may be the second-youngest team to ever reach the Finals, but their lack of playoff scars didn’t stop them from ",["A",{"href":"https://www.nba.com/news/4-takeaways-spurs-thunder-game-7"},"knocking off the defending champs in Game 7"]," in OKC. The inexperienced Spurs showed they were ready for the moment. Can they do it again?"],["P",{"style":"margin-left:0px;"},"With Wembanyama anchoring the defense, San Antonio’s perimeter defenders will look to slow down Jalen Brunson similarly to how they did reigning two-time Kia MVP Shai Gilgeous-Alexander, who averaged 25.9 points on 40.9% shooting. The Spurs must also limit live-ball turnovers, which fueled New York’s East onslaughts."],["HR"],["HR"],["HR"]]]],["DIV",{"class":"xl:rounded-lg xl:bg-[#0f0c25] xl:p-[0.3rem] xl:shadow-md xl:shadow-white/10 xl:border-[1px] xl:border-white/10 xl:border-solid hidden xl:block"},["DIV",{"class":"hidden xl:block text-white text-center font-[700] text-[0.4rem]"},["H2",{},"Transfer"]],["DIV",{"class":"league-transfer"},["DIV",{"class":"league-stats-scope-filter"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"league-stats-scope-trigger","aria-expanded":"false","aria-haspopup":"listbox"},["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{"class":"league-transfer-team-option"},["SPAN",{},"All"]]],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"}]]]],["DIV",{"class":"league-transfer-list"},["SECTION",{"class":"league-transfer-group"},["H3",{"class":"league-transfer-date"},"2026-09-04"],["DIV",{"class":"league-transfer-row"},["A",{"class":"league-transfer-player","href":"/basketball/player/Malaki%20Branham/vjxm8xtp58zq6od"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"","alt":"Malaki Branham","loading":"lazy","width":"48","height":"48","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"league-transfer-player-logo","srcset":"/api/imgproxy/s?src=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.cameltv.live%2Fbasketball%2Fplayer%2F153e43d94fb40cf82b04b7a217300952.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /api/imgproxy/s?src=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.cameltv.live%2Fbasketball%2Fplayer%2F153e43d94fb40cf82b04b7a217300952.png&w=96&q=75 2